{
  "name": "dsh-memoria",
  "version": "0.81.27",
  "description": "梅莫莉亚（Memoria／メモリア）—— 「DeepSeek档案」的**管家**：对档案文件默认只读（在岗标记、扫出作废口径、检索、机械体检、算编号与落点、收工那刻拦住漏落档），对我是主动打下手；**写入只开一个入口（落笔半）**，且只走「改档工具」那扇唯一的门 —— 先快照、写完自检、出新错就自动回滚，内核不在就一个字都不写。零运行时依赖。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "memory",
    "anti-compaction",
    "archive"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/",
    "assets/",
    "tools/",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "INSTALL.md",
    "使用说明-给人.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test.mjs"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
